                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "Thanks for the prompt reply! The quickfix window I referred to was this: <https://neovim.io/doc/user/quickfix.html>, invoked by `vim.diagnostic.setloclist`. \r\n\r\nYour solution works by filtering `filetype == 'qf'`. Thanks a lot!\r\n\r\n```diff\r\nrequire('mini.tabline').setup({\r\n  format = function(buf_id, label)\r\n+   if vim.bo[buf_id].filetype == 'qf' then return '' end\r\n    return MiniTabline.default_format(buf_id, label)\r\n  end,\r\n})\r\n```",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks for the prompt reply! The quickfix window I referred to was this: <a href=\"https://neovim.io/doc/user/quickfix.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://neovim.io/doc/user/quickfix.html</a>, invoked by <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.diagnostic.setloclist</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Your solution works by filtering <code class=\"notranslate\">filetype == 'qf'</code>. Thanks a lot!</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-diff notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"require('mini.tabline').setup({\n  format = function(buf_id, label)\n+   if vim.bo[buf_id].filetype == 'qf' then return '' end\n    return MiniTabline.default_format(buf_id, label)\n  end,\n})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">require('mini.tabline').setup({\n  format = function(buf_id, label)\n<span class=\"pl-mi1\"><span class=\"pl-mi1\">+</span>   if vim.bo[buf_id].filetype == 'qf' then return '' end</span>\n    return MiniTabline.default_format(buf_id, label)\n  end,\n})</pre></div>",
                    "bodyText": "Thanks for the prompt reply! The quickfix window I referred to was this: https://neovim.io/doc/user/quickfix.html, invoked by vim.diagnostic.setloclist.\nYour solution works by filtering filetype == 'qf'. Thanks a lot!\nrequire('mini.tabline').setup({\n  format = function(buf_id, label)\n+   if vim.bo[buf_id].filetype == 'qf' then return '' end\n    return MiniTabline.default_format(buf_id, label)\n  end,\n})",
