                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "Ah, I see.\r\n\r\nAnother approach is to set make such buffers not listed. Here is one Vimscript approach: `au FileType qf setlocal nobuflisted`. Better yet, create a '~/.config/nvim/after/ftplugin/qf.lua' file and put `vim.bo.buflisted = false` there.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Ah, I see.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Another approach is to set make such buffers not listed. Here is one Vimscript approach: <code class=\"notranslate\">au FileType qf setlocal nobuflisted</code>. Better yet, create a '~/.config/nvim/after/ftplugin/qf.lua' file and put <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.bo.buflisted = false</code> there.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "Ah, I see.\nAnother approach is to set make such buffers not listed. Here is one Vimscript approach: au FileType qf setlocal nobuflisted. Better yet, create a '~/.config/nvim/after/ftplugin/qf.lua' file and put vim.bo.buflisted = false there.",
